---
name: plan_memory
description: >
  The day's PLAN memory seeded onto each Smallville persona at t=0
  (backend/smallville_agents.py, attach_agents). It is the agent's own private
  intention -- "go to <destination> and <activity>" -- distinct from its persona,
  so retrieval has something to surface from turn 0 and the PLAN memory kind is
  exercised. The deterministic mock brain never reads it (it decides from
  location alone); real retrieval would surface it.
inputs:
  destination:
    type: string
    description: The place the persona plans to go, e.g. "Hobbs Cafe".
  activity:
    type: string
    description: What the persona plans to do there, e.g. "tending the cafe counter".
sample:
  destination: Hobbs Cafe
  activity: tending the cafe counter
---
Plan: go to {{ destination }} and {{ activity }}.
